TargaScript Basic Operators
=========================

Arithmetic Operators:
5 + 3 = 8
10 - 4 = 6
6 * 7 = 42
20 / 4 = 5
10 % 3 = 1

Comparison Operators:
5 == 5: true
5 != 10: true
10 > 5: true
5 < 10: true
5 >= 5: true
5 <= 10: true

Logical Operators:
true && true: true
true && false: false
true || false: true
false || false: false
!true: false
!false: true

String Concatenation:
"Hello " + "World" = Hello World

Increment and Decrement:
counter++ -> 6
counter-- twice -> 4

Basic operators demonstration completed!
